<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Berjaya Group back in the black.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Berjaya Group back in the black.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		81.17	 vs  loss     7.24</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)   9.5	  vs  loss     1.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	     6,309.07	 vs	 5,117.81</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 540.84	 vs	   283.57</p>
<p>    Minorities     less  262.38	 vs  less   154.04</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	202.02	 vs	    77.19</p>
<p>    Dividend    (percent) 12.5	  vs	    10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Berjaya Group Bhd is a holding company for the group's diversified activities and is also involved in property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
